==25 Years, 25 Mementos==
This year marks 25 years of RuneScape. That's a quarter of a century of 'Scaping! In other words, a quarter century of grinds and gains, action and achievements, fun and friendships forged across Gielinor... 

On top of 25 years of RuneScape, this month marks 13 years of Old School, bringing the perfect opportunity for a brand-new anniversary event. We've previously said that special events like anniversaries or birthdays would be reserved to milestone years, 25 years of 'Scaping is exactly that! So, get ready to take a walk down memory lane with: 25 Years, 25 Mementos. 

[[File:25th Anniversary Event- 25 Years, 25 Mementos! (1).jpg|thumb|600px|center|''If you can’t see the image above, click [https://cdn.runescape.com/assets/img/external/oldschool/2026/Newsposts/2026-02-18/25thanniversary.jpg here]!'']]

To kick things off, head to southern Varrock and chat to the Apprentice Wizard Gary Grayzag. He's been digging through his father's old notes on the mysterious Realm of Memories, and he's convinced he can open a portal there! To do it, he needs your help gathering 25 symbolic mementos - each one represents the skills and moments that have shaped RuneScape over the last 25 years. Will you help this young wizard work his magic and prove himself as a fully-fledged wizard?

[[File:25th Anniversary Event- 25 Years, 25 Mementos! (2).png|thumb|450px|center|''Remember asking "Where Varrock?" when you first set foot in Gielinor? Where better than Varrock to initiate the anniversary event?<br/>If you can’t see the image above, click [https://cdn.runescape.com/assets/img/external/oldschool/2026/Newsposts/2026-02-18/map.jpg here]!'']]

[[File:25th Anniversary Event- 25 Years, 25 Mementos! (3).png|thumb|500px|center|''Speak to Gary in southern Varrock to start the event.<br/>If you can’t see the image above, click [https://cdn.runescape.com/assets/img/external/oldschool/2026/Newsposts/2026-02-18/gary.jpg here]!'']]

Think you've been to the Realm of Memories before? Not this version! Once all mementos are in place, you'll unlock an ''updated version'' of the Realm of Memories - with new memories and NPCs including the retro Kalphite Queen in her 2004-style glory! To explore this realm where you can see and fight versions of creatures from the history of RuneScape, go ahead and embark on an adventure with Gary!

===Rewards===
Of course, it wouldn't be an anniversary without brand new rewards! The following four cosmetics await those of you complete the event:

* 25th Anniversary Helmet and 25th Anniversary Skeleton Tabard, inspired by Crunchy from the iconic Tim and Crunchy duo.
* 25th Anniversary Warrior Tabard, inspired from Tim likewise.
* 25th Anniversary 5x5 Hat - you'll know why when you play the event...

[[File:25th Anniversary Event- 25 Years, 25 Mementos! (4).png|thumb|400px|center|''25th Anniversary Helmet and 25th Anniversary Skeleton Tabard<br/>If you can’t see the image above, click [https://cdn.runescape.com/assets/img/external/oldschool/2026/Newsposts/2026-02-18/rewards1.jpg here]!'']]

[[File:25th Anniversary Event- 25 Years, 25 Mementos! (5).png|thumb|400px|center|''25th Anniversary Warrior Tabard and 25th Anniversary 5x5 Hat<br/>If you can’t see the image above, click [https://cdn.runescape.com/assets/img/external/oldschool/2026/Newsposts/2026-02-18/rewards2.jpg here]!'']]

Make sure to grab these goodies while you can! If you've completed the event, you'll also unlock the rewards from previous birthday events and the 20th Anniversary Event. Just claim them from Diango in Draynor or a toy box in your POH!

